strong\"> Lisa</span>: That's early!", "time": "3800"}, {"image": "engenn1le04ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Julie</span>: I take the 7 o'clock bus to work. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Lisa</span>: I drive to work. It takes so long!", "time": "11600"}, {"image": "engenn1le04ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Julie</span>: I check my e-mail and read the newspaper on the bus. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Lisa</span>: Do you work part-time?", "time": "18000"}, {"image": "engenn1le04ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 5, "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Julie</span>: No, I spend the day at work in meetings. I work full-time. I take night classes.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Lisa</span>: When do you clean the house? On Saturdays?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Julie</span>: I have no time to clean my house. It's a mess!", "time": "24000"}], "coverimg": "engenn1le04ob04re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"content": [], "type": "tips"}], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 2, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "id": 0, "text": "Letters of the Alphabet", "time": "1"}, {"image": "", "id": 1, "text": "Words that start with P", "time": "11500"}, {"image": "", "id": 2, "text": "Words that start with Q", "time": "19000"}, {"image": "", "id": 3, "text": "Words that start with R", "time": "26500"}, {"image": "", "id": 4, "text": "Words that start with S", "time": "34500"}, {"image": "", "id": 5, "text": "Words that start with T", "time": "42000"}], "video_src": "engenn1le04ob04re5vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "video", "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I can say and use the letters <span class=\"italic\">P</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Q</span>, <span class=\"italic\">R</span>, <span class=\"i